---
---

<header>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="label">Curriculum Vitæ</div>
    <div class="header-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>
          <span class="line1">Technicien Supérieur</span>
          <span class="line2">Métrologie <span>&</span> Qualité</span>
        </h1>
        <h2>Créer, fiabiliser et transmettre.</h2>
        <p class="tagline">
          Fort d'un parcours terrain en environnements exigeants : <strong>défense, aéronautique,
          industrie, pharmaceutique</strong>,
          je <strong>crée, adapte et fiabilise des méthodes de mesure</strong> là où elles sont critiques,
          je les documente rigoureusement et en assure la <strong>transmission</strong> aux équipes.<br />
          Convaincu que <strong>la bonne information au bon moment</strong> est elle-même un outil
          de mesure, je structure les connaissances pour qu'elles restent utilisables en <strong>audit</strong> comme sur le terrain.<br />
          Je suis particulièrement attaché à la <strong>précision</strong>, à la <strong>méthode</strong> et au respect des <strong>exigences qualité</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="header-meta">
        <div class="header-bg-num">±0</div>
        <div class="meta-item">📍 Emmerin, France</div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <a class="contact-link" href="tel:0603166412">06 03 16 64 12</a>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <!-- Version écran : Ouvre la modale -->
          <a class="contact-link email-trigger-btn openModalBtn screen-only">Me contacter</a>
          <!-- Version impression PDF : Affiche l'e-mail statique brut -->
          &nbsp;<span class="contact-link print-only" data-print-contact></span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/benjaminlepoutre" target="_blank">linkedin.com/in/benjaminlepoutre</a>
        </div>
        <div class="dispo">Disponible</div>
        <a href="/cv-court" class="btn-cv">↓ CV synthèse</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  header {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8d4a8;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 30%, transparent);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .header-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .label::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .label::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 .line1,
  h1 .line2 {
    display: block;
  }

  h1 .line2 > span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    max-width: 500px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .tagline strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .header-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .meta-item {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .meta-item a {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .meta-item a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .contact-trigger {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    font: inherit;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .contact-trigger:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .dispo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .dispo::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #4ade80;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  .btn-cv {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-cv:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }

  .header-bg-num {
    position: absolute;
    right: -1rem;
    top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 16rem;
    line-height: 1;
    /* border: 0.5px solid var(--accent); */
    color: var(--ghost);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 5%, var(--paper));
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .print-only { display: none !important; }
  .screen-only { display: block !important; }

  header .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    header {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    }

    .header-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .header-meta {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .header-bg-num {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) and (orientation: landscape) {
    .header-bg-num {
      display: block;
      font-size: 6rem;
      right: 1rem;
      top: auto;
      bottom: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    .dispo {
      display: none;
    }
    .btn-cv {
      display: none;
    }
    .dispo::before { animation: none; }
    .print-only {
      display: block !important;
      font-family: var(--mono) !important;
      font-size: 0.6rem !important;
      color: black !important;
    }
    .header-bg-num {
      transform: scale(0.85);
    }

    .screen-only {
      display: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
